### K-Drama Compass API — REST Client test requests
### Install: VSCode extension "REST Client" by Humao (humao.rest-client)
### Usage: Click "Send Request" above any request block
###
### Start the server first:
###   python scripts/run_api.py --reload
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Health Check (public — no auth needed)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Get a JWT Access Token
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### POST /auth/token — demo user
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=demo&password=kdrama123

###
# Save the token returned above, then set it here:
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Recommendations  (JWT required)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /recommend — hybrid model (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommend?drama_name=Crash Landing on You&top_n=10&model=hybrid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET /recommend — content-based model
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommend?drama_name=My Love from the Star&top_n=5&model=content_based
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET /recommend — collaborative model
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommend?drama_name=Goblin&top_n=5&model=collaborative
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET /recommend — without token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommend?drama_name=Goblin&top_n=5
Accept: application/json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Search  (public — no auth needed)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /search — search by title substring
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=love&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### GET /search — single result
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=Goblin&limit=5
Accept: application/json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. Sentiment  (public — no auth needed)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /sentiment/{drama_name}
GET {{baseUrl}}/sentiment/Crash Landing on You
Accept: application/json

### GET /sentiment — drama not found (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sentiment/NonExistentDrama
Accept: application/json


# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. Rate limit test
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /health — rapid fire (run multiple times quickly to trigger 429)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
